<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed } from 'vue';import { Play, Pause, X, ArrowUp, ArrowDown, ArrowUpRight, ListOrdered, RotateCcw } from 'lucide-vue-next';import { useAppStore,stateLabels,clock } from '../store';import { platforms } from '../../../shared/platforms';import PlatformMark from '../components/PlatformMark.vue'
const store=useAppStore();const active=computed(()=>store.tasks.filter(t=>!['finished','cancelled'].includes(t.status)))
</script>
<template><div class="page"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LEARNING QUEUES</p><h1>任务中心</h1><p class="subtitle">三个平台独立排队。同一平台的多个账号不会同时播放。</p></div><span class="badge green">{{store.running.length}} / 3 个通道运行中</span></div><div class="info-banner"><ListOrdered :size="20"/><p>暂停或待处理任务会保留当前通道。请恢复或取消它后再继续，不会跳过验证码、答题或章节解锁要求。</p></div>
 <section v-for="p in platforms" :key="p.id" class="panel queue-panel"><div class="queue-header"><div class="heading-inline"><PlatformMark :platform="p.id" small/><h2>{{p.name}}</h2><span class="muted">{{active.filter(t=>t.platform===p.id).length}} 项任务</span></div><div class="button-group"><button class="button compact" :disabled="!!store.busy||!store.running.some(t=>t.platform===p.id)" @click="store.run({type:'queue.pause',platform:p.id})"><Pause :size="15"/>暂停平台</button><button class="button primary compact" :disabled="!!store.busy||!active.some(t=>t.platform===p.id&&t.status==='queued')" @click="store.run({type:'queue.start',platform:p.id})"><Play :size="15"/>启动队列</button></div></div>
 <div v-if="!active.some(t=>t.platform===p.id)" class="queue-empty">还没有排队的课程。<button class="text-button" @click="store.navigate('courses')">去选择课程<ArrowUpRight :size="14"/></button></div>
 <article v-for="t in active.filter(t=>t.platform===p.id)" :key="t.id" class="task-row"><div class="task-main"><div class="task-title"><h3>{{t.title}}</h3><span :class="['badge',t.status==='running'?'green':['attention','recoverable'].includes(t.status)?'amber':'neutral']">{{stateLabels[t.status]}}</span></div><p class="muted">{{store.accountLabel(t.accountId)}} · 第 {{t.chapterIndex+1}} / {{t.chapters.length}} 章 · {{t.chapters[t.chapterIndex]?.title}}</p><div v-if="t.status==='running'" class="task-progress-row"><div class="progress-track"><span :style="{width:store.progress(t)+'%'}"></span></div><span>{{clock(t.currentTime)}} / {{clock(t.duration)}}</span></div><p v-if="t.reason" class="task-reason">{{t.reason}}</p><small class="muted">平台完成状态：{{t.platformCompletion==='complete'?'已确认完成':t.platformCompletion==='incomplete'?'未完成':'待确认'}}</small></div><div class="task-buttons"><button v-if="t.status==='running'" class="icon-button" aria-label="暂停任务" :disabled="!!store.busy" @click="store.run({type:'task.pause',taskId:t.id})"><Pause :size="18"/></button><button v-if="['paused','attention','recoverable'].includes(t.status)" class="button compact primary-soft" :disabled="!!store.busy" @click="store.run({type:'task.resume',taskId:t.id})"><RotateCcw :size="15"/>确认恢复</button><template v-if="t.status==='queued'"><button class="icon-button" aria-label="任务上移" @click="store.run({type:'task.reorder',taskId:t.id,direction:'up'})"><ArrowUp :size="17"/></button><button class="icon-button" aria-label="任务下移" @click="store.run({type:'task.reorder',taskId:t.id,direction:'down'})"><ArrowDown :size="17"/></button></template><button class="icon-button" aria-label="查看平台页面" @click="store.workbench(p.id)"><ArrowUpRight :size="18"/></button><button class="icon-button danger" aria-label="取消任务" :disabled="!!store.busy" @click="store.run({type:'task.cancel',taskId:t.id})"><X :size="18"/></button></div></article></section>
 <div class="footnote">已结束和已取消的任务可在「记录与设置」中查看。视频播放结束不等同于平台认定课程完成。</div></div></template>
